# AI-OS Stage 2A — environment template (SAFE TO COMMIT — no real values)

# Secrets are NOT loaded from this repo. Use the external owner-only secret file:
#   %LOCALAPPDATA%\AI-OS\stage2a.env
# That path lives outside the repository and is never committed.

# The external file format (key=value, one per line):
#   DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=<owner-entered value>
#   DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1   (optional)

# Anything listed below is a placeholder only. Real keys must never appear in
# this repo, in diffs, in evidence, or in logs.

